  "servings": 4,
  "summary": "Treat yourself to a fast and aromatic dinner with this vibrant <b>Indian noodle bowl</b> cooked entirely in a single pot for effortless cleanup. Delicate rice vermicelli absorbs a fragrant coconut broth infused with ground turmeric, garam masala, cumin, and fresh ginger. Crispy mustard seeds and tender yellow lentils build a comforting foundation of texture and subtle nutty notes throughout the dish. Fresh baby spinach and diced tomatoes add bright colors and light freshness to balance the warm spice blend. Because the noodles cook directly in the spiced coconut broth, every strand becomes thoroughly seasoned with velvety richness. Top each bowl with toasted cashews and a squeeze of fresh lime juice for a satisfying contrast of textures and flavors. This convenient meal brings regional Indian spice traditions into a streamlined, weeknight-friendly format that satisfies cravings quickly. Perfect for late evenings when you want maximum taste with minimal kitchen effort.",
